ngs  including the volcano attack and back  then  he even made it to the future this guy  has seen things  but now the info we need he states there  is  a way out of the loop i'm taking this to  mean that eventually  fortnite will become another genre of  gaming battle royale is huge right now  but over time different genres tend to  take over one another  like hero shooters become the thing to  play or mmos are first-person shooters  things change constantly and fortnite  has the foundation  to be all these genres at any point but  that's my opinion and not  fact so let's get back to johnsy his  final advice is to keep searching for  answers  and trust no one so ultimately we are  leaving the question of why we are  looped  and going straight for getting out of  the loop and to a reality we can control  and jonesy is the key to everything  wait wait wait wait can you  hear me hear me hear me  in fact there is somewhere else we can  get answers although we have waited a  long time for their return  the seven  quick recap the seven are seemingly  looped contestants in this game of  battle royale  who are attempting to escape it we know  the original visitor who came on a  meteor  and crashed the rocket and cracked the  dome above us and then his bigger  thicker brother the scientist who  continued his work  we also know of the paradigm who i  always thought was singularity but you  guys keep telling me i'm wrong  so i will back off there and stop  assuming they're the same person  paradigm was spotted during the mech  battle to save the zero point  in the best live event ever in my humble  opinion  in fact let's make that the question  today what was the greatest live event  ever this chapter we've seen little  evidence of the seven  although we have seen a carving on a  tree and many people believe  that midas is in fact one of the seven  due to his ability to control his  memories  and build the device which harnessed the  zero point  and now in season five we have