e up  this image with the one found in season  two  and they do not match at all either this  is concept art which is highly likely  or this is another version of the island  from another dimension and reality  what we know from the past is that epic  love to foreshadow future in trailers  like the sword at neo tilted or bunker  johnsy  or the flooding of the island the future  may be in front of our eyes we just need  to look harder but let's not forget  about the past either  the past can still give us answers i'm  looking at you the enforcer  this is your season so there we have it  six story secrets hidden in plain sight  in season five  have you noticed anything else that  links to the story maybe an npc  i haven't found yet please use the  comments below to converse and build  ideas and i'll check back regularly  thanks to everyone who used code  adamarrow to pick up the battle pass  this season  i truly appreciate you and i wouldn't be  able to do so many videos about fortnite  right now without you  so thank you kindly i'm adam from  playstation grenade you're awesome i'll  see you next time

